# i18n Rules

## Locales

`tr` (default), `en`, `de`, `ru`, `ar`

## Allowed

- `getTranslations()` in Server Components
- `useTranslations()` in Client Components
- `Link`, `redirect` from `@/i18n/navigation`
- Translation tables for DB content
- RTL `dir` attribute for Arabic

## Forbidden

- Hardcoded user-facing strings
- `next/link` for locale-aware navigation
- `next/navigation` redirect for locale routes
- Physical CSS directions (`ml-`, `mr-`) — use logical (`ms-`, `me-`)
- JSONB for translatable DB content

## Adding a locale

1. `LOCALES` in `src/config/constants.ts`
2. `messages/<locale>.json`
3. Update `/docs/I18N_RULES.md`

## Before modifying i18n

Read `/docs/I18N_RULES.md`.
